2. Participation in this project

You may copy, run and modify the repository's own tools, checks, templates and
organizational documentation as reasonably necessary to prepare, test, review
and submit contributions to this project. You may make draft changes to project
materials and share them through this project's contribution workflow, to the
extent the relevant project rights holder can authorize those changes. Keep
attribution and rights notices, clearly identify proposed changes as drafts,
and respect third-party restrictions. No prior acceptance of CONTRIBUTOR_TERMS.md
is required merely to prepare a proposal; acceptance is required for the separate
production licence described there when incorporating a creative contribution.

This participation permission includes necessary working copies and project
forks. It does not authorize independent commercial exploitation, distribution
of a general-purpose asset library, or reuse of protected creative assets in
unrelated projects. It supplements, rather than limits, GitHub platform rights.

