This notice does not create copyright in ideas, facts, styles, public-domain
material or AI output where protection does not arise under applicable law.
No general trademark licence, endorsement or official status is granted.

6. Contributions and permissions

Contributor permissions are handled separately under CONTRIBUTOR_TERMS.md or
a specific written agreement. Repository access, a merge, a canon decision or
